# NRC: the neural radiance cache (Mueller et al. 2021; Engine/Graphic/Neural/NeuralRadianceCache.hpp, contract Notion Wiki
# «NRC — контракт»). PathTracing.RadianceCache Nrc: the path tracer's paths end in the cache where their spread passes the
# threshold (or at the bounce limit), the cache trains online every frame from sparse training paths (self-training), and
# the composite adds T * cache(x) * (D_d + D_s) into the accumulation and the denoiser's lobe sums.
Дано F:/BistroFoliageProj dnx_Night_pt, GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced, PathTracing.Denoiser Off, PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 1, PathTracing.PathsPerFrame 1 (PT 1 spp), camera fixed on the street.
Когда PathTracing.RadianceCache Nrc; shoot nrc after 120 frames; DesertCtl state nrc.
Когда PathTracing.RadianceCache Off; shoot off after 120 frames.
Когда PathTracing.RadianceCache Off, PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 64, PathTracing.PathsPerFrame 64; shoot ref after 120 frames.
Тогда [nrc_night]: RMSE(nrc, ref) < RMSE(off, ref) (the cache's frame is closer to the 64 spp reference than the plain 1 spp frame); mean luminance of nrc within 5 % of ref; state nrc: active true, kernelPath named, trainingSamples > 0, renderQueries > 0, trainLoss < firstTrainLoss (the loss falls); 0 VUID in the log.
